sn35.228:3.3 starts: The knowledge-master who has lived the holy life,
sn35.228:3.4 starts: Reached the world’s end, is called one
sn35.229:4.3 starts: Passed away, he cannot be measured, I
sn35.229:4.4 starts: He has bewildered the King of Death.”
