sn35.95:35.5 starts: For one diminishing suffering thus
sn36.12:6.3 starts: Standing in Dhamma, with the body’s breakup,
sn36.12:6.4 starts: The knowledge-master cannot be reckoned.
sn36.1:3.3 starts: With the destruction of feelings
sn36.1:3.4 starts: A bhikkhu is hungerless and fully quenched.
